i: Esik\u00e4sittely ja Turvaportti (Vaihe 1)", "language": "auto"}}, "335": {"id": "8eec805c-5f80-4d0a-b1d9-43cba117b2ac", "type": "claim", "term": "Denning & Denning 1977...", "definition": "Luku 2.4.2.4, S\u00e4\u00e4nt\u00f6 1: Luottamuksen Keh\u00e4), joka pakottaa validoinnin ennen prosessointia.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.452072", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Denning & Denning 1977", "full_reference": "Denning, Dorothy E. & Denning, Peter J. 1977. Certification of programs for secure information flow. Communications of the ACM, 20(7), s. 504\u2013513. Saatavilla: https://doi.org/10.1145/359636.359712.", "concept_context": "2.3.3 Vartija-agentti: Esik\u00e4sittely ja Turvaportti (Vaihe 1)", "language": "auto"}}, "336": {"id": "6340040f-fc0e-4eea-af1f-501e194d1b99", "type": "claim", "term": "Lewis ym. 2020; Shuster ym. 2021...", "definition": "Retrieval-Augmented Generation) tiedonhakustrategiaa konteksti-ikkunan sis\u00e4ll\u00e4, joka v\u00e4hent\u00e4\u00e4 merkitt\u00e4v\u00e4sti kielimallien taipumusta hallusinointiin.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.479355", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Lewis ym. 2020; Shuster ym. 2021", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.4 Analyytikko-agentti: Todistepohjainen Ankkurointi (Vaihe 2)", "language": "auto"}}, "337": {"id": "00901218-61b0-4307-9226-5f50175fa693", "type": "claim", "term": "Ahmad ym. 2024...", "definition": "RAG-arkkitehtuureilla on kuitenkin tunnettuja heikkouksia.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.506699", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Ahmad ym. 2024", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.4 Analyytikko-agentti: Todistepohjainen Ankkurointi (Vaihe 2)", "language": "auto"}}, "338": {"id": "b639f7b2-2eb8-4656-aed4-3f548addbbe7", "type": "claim", "term": "Anderson & Krathwohl 2001...", "definition": "Sen teht\u00e4v\u00e4n\u00e4 on muodostaa hypoteesi k\u00e4ytt\u00e4j\u00e4n osaamistasosta soveltamalla Kognitiivista Arviointimatriisia (Taulukko 1), joka perustuu Bloomin taksonomiaan.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.535027", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Anderson & Krathwohl 2001", "full_reference": "Anderson, Lorin W. & Krathwohl, David R. (toim.) 2001. A taxonomy for learning, teaching, and assessing: A revision of Bloom\u2019s taxonomy of educational objectives. New York: Longman.", "concept_context": "2.3.5 Loogikko-agentti: Argumentaation Rakentaminen (Vaihe 3)", "language": "auto"}}, "339": {"id": "6018f54a-e800-4a40-86b0-f6d9d2cf0478", "type": "claim", "term": "Toulmin 2003...", "definition": "Loogikko-agentti j\u00e4sent\u00e4\u00e4 analyysinsa systemaattisesti k\u00e4ytt\u00e4en Toulminin argumentaatiomallia.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.563995", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Toulmin 2003", "full_reference": "Toulmin, Stephen E. 2003. The uses of argument. P\u00e4ivitetty painos. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press. Saatavilla: https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511802034.", "concept_context": "2.3.5 Loogikko-agentti: Argumentaation Rakentaminen (Vaihe 3)", "language": "auto"}}, "340": {"id": "f079fa5a-3750-4725-bf1a-c3cccb875195", "type": "claim", "term": "Popper 1934...", "definition": "Ryhm\u00e4n teht\u00e4v\u00e4 on toimia j\u00e4rjestelm\u00e4n sis\u00e4isen\u00e4 \u201dpaholaisen asianajajana\u201d, ja sen toiminta perustuu Karl Popperin falsifiointiperiaatteeseen: tieteellinen totuus selvitet\u00e4\u00e4n yritt\u00e4m\u00e4ll\u00e4 aktiivisesti kumota esitetyt v\u00e4itteet (ks.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.592283", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Popper 1934", "full_reference": "Popper, Karl 1934. Logik der Forschung. Vienna: Julius Springer.", "concept_context": "2.3.6 Kriitikkoryhm\u00e4: Systemaattinen Falsifiointi (Vaihe 4)", "language": "auto"}}, "341": {"id": "202c713a-3b45-40d0-8a42-a684e693e34c", "type": "claim", "term": "Wynn, Satija & Hadfield 2025...", "definition": "Teht\u00e4v\u00e4: Agentin on vastustettava \"konsensuksen tyranniaa\" yll\u00e4pit\u00e4m\u00e4ll\u00e4 perusteltua erimielisyytt\u00e4.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.621895", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Wynn, Satija & Hadfield 2025", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.1 Looginen Falsifioija-agentti (\"Argumentaation Auditoija\")", "language": "auto"}}, "342": {"id": "2539e16c-3069-4bc6-a3c9-717426a7df2e", "type": "claim", "term": "Ganascia 2017...", "definition": "Lis\u00e4ksi teko\u00e4lyn toiminnan stokastisuus mutkistaa suoraviivaista falsifiointia.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.650726", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Ganascia 2017", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.1 Looginen Falsifioija-agentti (\"Argumentaation Auditoija\")", "language": "auto"}}, "343": {"id": "692c282f-19b2-4a00-83f3-b31f3dc968c5", "type": "claim", "term": "Walton, Reed & Macagno 2008...", "definition": "Siksi t\u00e4ss\u00e4 viitekehyksess\u00e4 falsifiointia k\u00e4ytet\u00e4\u00e4n t\u00e4sm\u00e4ty\u00f6kaluna: etsit\u00e4\u00e4n suoria, loogisia ristiriitoja reflektion ja keskusteluhistorian v\u00e4lill\u00e4 hy\u00f6dynt\u00e4m\u00e4ll\u00e4 argumentaatioskeemojen kriittisi\u00e4 kysymyksi\u00e4.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.677381", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Walton, Reed & Macagno 2008", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.1 Looginen Falsifioija-agentti (\"Argumentaation Auditoija\")", "language": "auto"}}, "344": {"id": "ba53952b-04de-42d6-b358-41c878a025f7", "type": "claim", "term": "Trivedi ym. 2024...", "definition": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 iteratiivinen l\u00e4hestymistapa on v\u00e4ltt\u00e4m\u00e4t\u00f6n monivaiheisessa p\u00e4\u00e4ttelyss\u00e4.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.705368", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Trivedi ym. 2024", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.2 Faktuaalinen ja Eettinen Valvoja-agentti (\"Todisteiden Valvoja\")", "language": "auto"}}, "345": {"id": "5fed8259-cbea-4d96-91ae-db97c89c094b", "type": "claim", "term": "Jagerman ym. 2023...", "definition": "Se k\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 edistyneit\u00e4 tekniikoita l\u00f6yt\u00e4\u00e4kseen tietoa, joka j\u00e4i alkuper\u00e4iselt\u00e4 haulta piiloon: Kyselynlaajennus: Hakulausekkeiden muokkaaminen uusista n\u00e4k\u00f6kulmista.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.731010", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Jagerman ym. 2023", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.2 Faktuaalinen ja Eettinen Valvoja-agentti (\"Todisteiden Valvoja\")", "language": "auto"}}, "346": {"id": "15f68bc9-2570-49c9-91ad-e7bc6cd8dfb4", "type": "claim", "term": "Gao ym. 2022...", "definition": "HyDE (Hypothetical Document Embeddings): Agentti kuvittelee ideaalin dokumentin, joka kumoaisi v\u00e4itteen, ja k\u00e4ytt\u00e4\u00e4 sit\u00e4 hakuna.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.758911", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Gao ym. 2022", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.2 Faktuaalinen ja Eettinen Valvoja-agentti (\"Todisteiden Valvoja\")", "language": "auto"}}, "347": {"id": "c4bc1a31-dbc1-4b3d-9408-5ed3b01bf787", "type": "claim", "term": "Ye ym. 2025...", "definition": "Gemini) (ks.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.785985", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Ye ym. 2025", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.2 Faktuaalinen ja Eettinen Valvoja-agentti (\"Todisteiden Valvoja\")", "language": "auto"}}, "348": {"id": "b15392c2-533a-45c3-8276-a01e66e9977c", "type": "claim", "term": "Cemri ym. 2025...", "definition": "Jos kaikki agentit k\u00e4ytt\u00e4v\u00e4t samaa mallia, ne saattavat toistaa samat virheet ja hallusinaatiot (\"sokeat pisteet\").", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.817766", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Cemri ym. 2025", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.2 Faktuaalinen ja Eettinen Valvoja-agentti (\"Todisteiden Valvoja\")", "language": "auto"}}, "349": {"id": "a360c0a8-0853-4c0b-a89d-ee9128a37854", "type": "claim", "term": "Weidinger ym. 2021...", "definition": "Eettinen tarkastus: Agentti etsii aktiivisesti vakavia eettisi\u00e4 rikkomuksia, kuten syrjint\u00e4\u00e4 tai l\u00e4hteiden tahallista v\u00e4\u00e4ristely\u00e4.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.853290", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Weidinger ym. 2021", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.2 Faktuaalinen ja Eettinen Valvoja-agentti (\"Todisteiden Valvoja\")", "language": "auto"}}, "350": {"id": "64ed4a41-487a-4f5d-a68d-28df7d47606f", "type": "claim", "term": "Shuster ym. 2021...", "definition": "Mekanismi on suunniteltu torjumaan kielimallien taipumusta hallusinointiin ankkuroimalla v\u00e4itteet ulkoiseen, todennettavaan tietoon.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.881529", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Shuster ym. 2021", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.3 Faktuaalinen Verifiointiprotokolla (Google Search API)", "language": "auto"}}, "351": {"id": "15b8ea5f-a9f7-4569-8bbe-c0f6b29c69c3", "type": "claim", "term": "Popper 1934...", "definition": "Seulonta priorisoi v\u00e4itteit\u00e4, jotka sis\u00e4lt\u00e4v\u00e4t spesifej\u00e4 vuosilukuja, historiallisia tapahtumia, henkil\u00f6it\u00e4 tai tieteellisi\u00e4 faktoja, noudattaen periaatetta, jonka mukaan \"kovat faktat\" ovat tehokkain falsifioinnin kohde.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.908711", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Popper 1934", "full_reference": "Popper, Karl 1934. Logik der Forschung. Vienna: Julius Springer.", "concept_context": "2.3.5.3 Faktuaalinen Verifiointiprotokolla (Google Search API)", "language": "auto"}}, "352": {"id": "e6f3f2c8-da06-43f0-bdb8-35567c29713a", "type": "claim", "term": "Lewis ym. 2020...", "definition": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 vaihe on kriittinen \"maailmanmallin\" laajentamiseksi kielimallin staattisen koulutusdatan ulkopuolelle.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.937014", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Lewis ym. 2020", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.3 Faktuaalinen Verifiointiprotokolla (Google Search API)", "language": "auto"}}, "353": {"id": "133e9371-e931-4c4a-8c6e-c299048dadf7", "type": "claim", "term": "Walton ym. 2008...", "definition": "Abduktiivinen Haasto: Agentti soveltaa Occamin partaveist\u00e4.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.961181", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Walton ym. 2008", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.4 Kausaalinen Analyytikko-agentti (\"Temporaalinen Auditoija\")", "language": "auto"}}, "354": {"id": "9cb2ff48-a222-4873-b82c-9ee8e8c3cf66", "type": "claim", "term": "Festinger 1957...", "definition": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 analyysi perustuu kognitiivisen dissonanssin tunnistamiseen.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:29.983889", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Festinger 1957", "full_reference": "Festinger, Leon 1957. A theory of cognitive dissonance. Stanford: Stanford University Press.", "concept_context": "2.3.5.5 Performatiivisuuden Tunnistaja-agentti (\"K\u00e4ytt\u00e4ytymisanalyytikko\")", "language": "auto"}}, "355": {"id": "3f5fee71-4720-4a31-b329-b7cf41e7bcc9", "type": "claim", "term": "de Bruin ym. 2023...", "definition": "Kognitiivinen investointi: Vastaako oivallukseen k\u00e4ytetty kognitiivinen ty\u00f6panos sen v\u00e4itetty\u00e4 merkitt\u00e4vyytt\u00e4 ?", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:30.008930", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "de Bruin ym. 2023", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "2.3.5.5 Performatiivisuuden Tunnistaja-agentti (\"K\u00e4ytt\u00e4ytymisanalyytikko\")", "language": "auto"}}, "356": {"id": "e94c41d5-b617-44bb-b3b1-3d49b97b57d9", "type": "claim", "term": "Dufner ym. 2019...", "definition": "Itsetehostuksen Indikaattorit: Etsit\u00e4\u00e4n merkkej\u00e4 itset