sema: Markkinarako laadulliselle arvioinnille", "language": "auto"}}, "399": {"id": "0f9c9020-e497-486d-9018-286945fda9c1", "type": "claim", "term": "Displayr 2024...", "definition": "N\u00e4m\u00e4 keskittyv\u00e4t arviointiteht\u00e4vien, kuten monivalintojen, laatimiseen ja v\u00e4ltt\u00e4v\u00e4t monimutkaisen, laadullisen todistusaineiston analysointia.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:31.110967", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Displayr 2024", "full_reference": "Displayr 2024. Discover the 5 best AI tools for qualitative data analysis. Displayr. Saatavilla: https://www.displayr.com/discover-the-5-best-ai-tools-for-qualitative-data-analysis/.", "concept_context": "3.2 Kaupallinen maisema: Markkinarako laadulliselle arvioinnille", "language": "auto"}}, "400": {"id": "95eaadb7-61ee-4d55-8ac2-997b94f3c1f7", "type": "claim", "term": "Li ym. 2025...", "definition": "Viimeaikaiset tutkimukset vahvistavat t\u00e4m\u00e4n aukon: nykyiset ty\u00f6kalut laiminly\u00f6v\u00e4t systemaattisesti \"kriittisen ajattelun ja kehittyneet vuorovaikutuskyvyt\".", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:31.136219", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Li ym. 2025", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "3.2 Kaupallinen maisema: Markkinarako laadulliselle arvioinnille", "language": "auto"}}, "401": {"id": "54e17af6-d33c-4765-b9fa-47f8d0274c51", "type": "claim", "term": "Suskie 2009...", "definition": "Koska laadullinen arviointi on aikaa viev\u00e4\u00e4.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:31.161669", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Suskie 2009", "full_reference": "Suskie, Linda 2009. Assessing student learning: A common sense guide. 2. painos. San Fr