essin analyysiin.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:30.960678", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Bezanilla ym. 2019; Li ym. 2025", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "3.1 Akateeminen maisema: Olemassa olevien osien uusi synteesi", "language": "auto"}}, {"id": "15af1538-69b3-48fc-ae8c-7d68860b3862", "type": "claim", "term": "Lippi & Torroni 2016...", "definition": "Argumentaation laadun analyysille l\u00f6ytyy vastine argumentinlouhinnan (Argumentation Mining) alalta, joka keskittyy argumenttirakenteiden automaattiseen tunnistamiseen tekstist\u00e4.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:30.986264", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Lippi & Torroni 2016", "full_reference": "Lippi, Marco & Torroni, Paolo 2016. Argumentation mining: State of the art. ACM Transactions on Internet Technology, 16(2), s. 1\u201325. Saatavilla: https://doi.org/10.1145/2850417.", "concept_context": "3.1 Akateeminen maisema: Olemassa olevien osien uusi synteesi", "language": "auto"}}, {"id": "99ad8f36-31de-4f2d-82d1-a727c26e3e98", "type": "claim", "term": "Wachsmuth ym. 2017...", "definition": "Rakenteellisten piirteiden analyysin on osoitettu parantavan automaattista arviointia, mik\u00e4 tukee Loogikko-agentin Toulmin-pohjaista analyysia.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:31.011865", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Wachsmuth ym. 2017", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "3.1 Akateeminen maisema: Olemassa olevien osien uusi synteesi", "language": "auto"}}, {"id": "0701bf98-70ac-486d-9fe8-9b8de8e72afd", "type": "claim", "term": "Wisse & Greve 2023...", "definition": "T\u00e4m\u00e4 heijastaa laajempaa suuntausta, jossa teko\u00e4lysovellukset eriytyv\u00e4t kahdentyyppisiin mekanismeihin.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:31.036437", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Wisse & Greve 2023", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "3.2 Kaupallinen maisema: Markkinarako laadulliselle arvioinnille", "language": "auto"}}, {"id": "56554263-0d83-4a34-83ce-2172ecf2d396", "type": "claim", "term": "Larson ym. 2024...", "definition": "N\u00e4m\u00e4 keskittyv\u00e4t oppimisprosessiin, mutta eiv\u00e4t tuota auditoitavaa arviota osaamisesta, sill\u00e4 teko\u00e4lyn k\u00e4ytt\u00f6\u00e4 varsinaisessa arvioinnissa pidet\u00e4\u00e4n haasteellisena.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:31.061799", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Larson ym. 2024", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "3.2 Kaupallinen maisema: Markkinarako laadulliselle arvioinnille", "language": "auto"}}, {"id": "421f2c2a-4ea9-430d-8665-03c405ecf132", "type": "claim", "term": "Boussioux 2025...", "definition": "kysymystenluonti).", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:31.086132", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Boussioux 2025", "full_reference": "Boussioux, Leonard 2025. Revolutionize quality assurance with AI. Mareana. Saatavilla: https://mareana.com/whitepaper/qa-playbook/.", "concept_context": "3.2 Kaupallinen maisema: Markkinarako laadulliselle arvioinnille", "language": "auto"}}, {"id": "0f9c9020-e497-486d-9018-286945fda9c1", "type": "claim", "term": "Displayr 2024...", "definition": "N\u00e4m\u00e4 keskittyv\u00e4t arviointiteht\u00e4vien, kuten monivalintojen, laatimiseen ja v\u00e4ltt\u00e4v\u00e4t monimutkaisen, laadullisen todistusaineiston analysointia.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:31.110967", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Displayr 2024", "full_reference": "Displayr 2024. Discover the 5 best AI tools for qualitative data analysis. Displayr. Saatavilla: https://www.displayr.com/discover-the-5-best-ai-tools-for-qualitative-data-analysis/.", "concept_context": "3.2 Kaupallinen maisema: Markkinarako laadulliselle arvioinnille", "language": "auto"}}, {"id": "95eaadb7-61ee-4d55-8ac2-997b94f3c1f7", "type": "claim", "term": "Li ym. 2025...", "definition": "Viimeaikaiset tutkimukset vahvistavat t\u00e4m\u00e4n aukon: nykyiset ty\u00f6kalut laiminly\u00f6v\u00e4t systemaattisesti \"kriittisen ajattelun ja kehittyneet vuorovaikutuskyvyt\".", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:31.136219", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Li ym. 2025", "full_reference": null, "concept_context": "3.2 Kaupallinen maisema: Markkinarako laadulliselle arvioinnille", "language": "auto"}}, {"id": "54e17af6-d33c-4765-b9fa-47f8d0274c51", "type": "claim", "term": "Suskie 2009...", "definition": "Koska laadullinen arviointi on aikaa viev\u00e4\u00e4.", "source_file": "Holistinen Mestaruus.docx", "job_id": "f99b2fd9-6c79-4559-a3d5-6587f6652a29", "ingested_at": "2026-02-17T03:38:31.161669", "metadata": {"citation_keys": [], "citation_text": "Suskie 2009", "full_reference": "Suskie, Linda 2009. Assessing student learning: A common sense guide. 2. painos. San Francisco: Jossey-Bass.", "concept_context": "3.2 Kaupallinen maisema: Markkinarako laadulliselle arvioinnille", "language": "auto"}}, {"id": "cebfbcad-1c2e-439e-8f37-636957bda851", "type": "claim", "term": "Raisch & Krakowski 2021; Brooks 1987...", "definition": "Yleisk\u00e4ytt\u00f6isten teko\u00e4lymallien nopea kehitys mahdollistaa monimutkaisemmat arkkitehtuurit, mutta lis\u00e4\u00e4ntyv\u00e4 kompleksisuus paljastaa sama